{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "2JN",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The elder to the elect lady, and her children, whom I love in the truth; and not I only, but also all they that have known the truth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the truth's sake which dwelleth in us, and shall be with us for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grace be with you, mercy, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " peace from God the Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I rejoiced greatly, that I found of thy children walking in truth, as we have received a commandment from the Father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote a new commandment to thee, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And this is love, that we walk according to his commandments. This is the commandment, that as ye have heard from the beginning, ye should walk in it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For many deceivers have entered into the world, who confess not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh. This is a deceiver, and an antichrist.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Look to yourselves, that we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever transgresseth, and abideth not in the doctrine of Christ, hath not God. He that abideth in the doctrine of Christ, he hath both the Father and the Son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If any one cometh to you, and bringeth not this doctrine, receive him not into ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " house, neither wish him happiness:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he that wisheth him happiness, is partaker of his evil deeds.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Having many things to write to you, I would not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "write",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with paper and ink: but I trust to come to you, and speak face to face, that our joy may be full.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JN.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2JN.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The children of thy elect sister greet thee. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
